              <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-foreground">Upload Photo (20–50 KB)</h3>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Format your portrait to 200×230 px and 20–50 KB JPG. Ensure clean light/white backdrop with both ears visible and no reflections on prescription spectacles.
            </p>
          </article>

          <!-- Step 3 -->
          <article class="rounded-xl border border-border bg-muted/20 p-4 space-y-2">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-primary text-primary-foreground font-bold text-xs flex items-center justify-center">3</span>
