            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed">
              Upload Left Thumb (240×240 px, 20–50 KB) and Handwritten Declaration (800×400 px, 50–100 KB). Complete final submission and save your Application PDF.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
