          </a>
          <a href="/blog/ibps-rrb-po-prelims-mains-preparation-strategy-interview-guide/" class="min-h-11 inline-flex items-center rounded-xl bg-primary/10 border border-primary/25 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold text-primary hover:bg-primary/20 transition">
